60365). May attenuate p53/TP53 activation through the E3 ubiquitin ligase HUWE1 (PubMed:33660365)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}